      "writtenOn": "2021-06-03T15:28:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have found a better approach to this issue: I will create an allow list of alternatives/features that we can tolerate in the fips140 module, by ignoring them under certain conditions (e.g., we lose compatibility with VHE or pseudo-NMI). All other alternatives will trigger an error if they get instantiated inside the FIPS140 module.",
